---
// Demonstrates baseline alignment vs vertical center alignment when mixing font sizes.
// A common AI pattern is applying `flex items-center gap-2` to everything, causing
// smaller secondary text to awkwardly float relative to the primary headline.
---

<figure class="bvc">
  <div class="bvc-grid">
    <!-- Center Aligned (Wrong) -->
    <div class="bvc-card is-wrong">
      <div class="bvc-header">
        <span class="bvc-badge bvc-badge-wrong">
          <span data-lang-en>items-center (awkward)</span>
          <span data-lang-vi>items-center (lệch trục)</span>
        </span>
        <code>align-items: center</code>
      </div>

      <div class="bvc-box">
        <div class="bvc-sample bvc-center">
          <span class="bvc-title">Invoice #1042</span>
          <span class="bvc-sub">Paid on Oct 14</span>
          <!-- Center guide line -->
          <div class="bvc-guide bvc-guide-center" title="Vertical center line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="bvc-desc">
        <span data-lang-en>The small text vertically centers against the 32px bounding box, floating unnaturally above the reading line.</span>
        <span data-lang-vi>Chữ nhỏ căn giữa theo hộp 32px của tiêu đề, bị treo lơ lửng tách biệt khỏi đường đọc tự nhiên.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Baseline Aligned (Correct) -->
    <div class="bvc-card is-correct">
      <div class="bvc-header">
        <span class="bvc-badge bvc-badge-correct">
          <span data-lang-en>items-baseline (grounded)</span>
          <span data-lang-vi>items-baseline (chuẩn xác)</span>
        </span>
        <code>align-items: baseline</code>
      </div>

      <div class="bvc-box">
        <div class="bvc-sample bvc-baseline">
          <span class="bvc-title">Invoice #1042</span>
          <span class="bvc-sub">Paid on Oct 14</span>
          <!-- Baseline guide line -->
          <div class="bvc-guide bvc-guide-baseline" title="Baseline datum line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="bvc-desc">
        <span data-lang-en>Both sizes rest on the exact same baseline datum. The eye perceives them as one coherent, grounded unit.</span>
        <span data-lang-vi>Cả hai kích cỡ cùng đặt chân lên đúng một đường baseline. Mắt tiếp nhận chúng như một khối thông tin liền mạch.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Why baseline alignment beats vertical centering when pairing different font sizes. Red dashed line is the alignment axis.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tại sao căn theo baseline lại vượt trội so với căn giữa khi phối hợp các cỡ chữ khác nhau. Nét đứt đỏ là trục căn chỉnh.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bvc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bvc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .bvc-card { background: var(--bg-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; }
  .bvc-card.is-correct { border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); }
  .bvc-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .bvc-badge { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .bvc-badge-wrong { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: var(--red); }
  .bvc-badge-correct { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: var(--green, #10b981); }
  .bvc code { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
  
  .bvc-box { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px 16px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
  .bvc-sample { display: flex; gap: 12px; position: relative; }
  .bvc-center { align-items: center; }
  .bvc-baseline { align-items: baseline; }
  
  .bvc-title { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); line-height: 1; }
  .bvc-sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1; }
  
  .bvc-guide { position: absolute; left: -16px; right: -16px; height: 1px; border-bottom: 1.5px dashed var(--red); pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.85; }
  .bvc-guide-center { top: 50%; }
  .bvc-guide-baseline { bottom: 0px; }
  
  .bvc-desc { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-body); }
  .bvc figcaption { margin-top: 0.8em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
